---
title: Test - Start / Resume Session Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CP as Chat Panel
    participant Store as Session Store
    participant WS as WebSocket Client
    participant API as Chat API (Server)

    Dev->>CP: Opens app / selects session
    CP->>Store: Read existing sessions
    Store-->>CP: Session list
    Note right of Store: assert returns list (empty OK for first use)
    CP->>Dev: Show session list or empty state
    Note right of CP: assert UI renders session list or empty state prompt

    alt New session
        Dev->>CP: Click "New session"
        CP->>Store: Create session (new ID)
        Store-->>CP: Session ID
        Note right of Store: assert sessionId is non-empty string
        Note right of Store: assert sessionId is unique across existing sessions
    else Resume session
        Dev->>CP: Click existing session
        CP->>Store: Load session messages
        Store-->>CP: ChatMessage[]
        Note right of Store: assert returns ChatMessage[] (may be empty)
        Note right of Store: assert each message has id, role, content
        CP->>Dev: Render message history
        Note right of CP: assert message count matches store
        Note right of CP: assert message order is chronological
    end

    CP->>WS: connect(sessionId)
    Note right of WS: assert sessionId matches selected/created session
    WS->>API: Open WebSocket connection
    API-->>WS: Connection established
    Note right of WS: assert status transitions: connecting -> connected
    WS-->>CP: Status: connected
    Note right of CP: assert UI reflects connected state
    Note right of CP: assert send button is enabled
